
### ==========================================
### REAL-TIME SPORTS COURT BOOKING SYSTEM
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@date = 2026-10-15


### ==========================================
### 1. STUDENT REGISTRATION
### ==========================================

### Register Student 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Tharunika",
  "email": "Tharunika@example.com",
  "contactInfo": "9638527410"
}


### Register Student 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Arun",
  "email": "arun@example.com",
  "contactInfo": "9876543211"
}


### View All Students
GET {{baseUrl}}/students


### View Student By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/1


### ==========================================
### 2. SPORTS FACILITY MANAGEMENT
### ==========================================

### Add Badminton Court
POST {{baseUrl}}/facilities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityName": "Badminton Court 1",
  "sportType": "Badminton",
  "location": "Indoor Sports Complex",
  "openingTime": "06:00:00",
  "closingTime": "20:00:00",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}


### Add Basketball Court
POST {{baseUrl}}/facilities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityName": "Basketball Court",
  "sportType": "Basketball",
  "location": "College Main Ground",
  "openingTime": "06:00:00",
  "closingTime": "19:00:00",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}


### Add Cricket Nets
POST {{baseUrl}}/facilities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityName": "Cricket Practice Nets",
  "sportType": "Cricket",
  "location": "College Sports Ground",
  "openingTime": "07:00:00",
  "closingTime": "18:00:00",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}


### Add Football Ground
POST {{baseUrl}}/facilities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityName": "Football Ground",
  "sportType": "Football",
  "location": "Outdoor Sports Complex",
  "openingTime": "06:00:00",
  "closingTime": "18:00:00",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}


### View All Sports Facilities
GET {{baseUrl}}/facilities


### View Facility By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/facilities/1


### Update Facility Details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/facilities/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityName": "Badminton Court 1",
  "sportType": "Badminton",
  "location": "Indoor Sports Complex",
  "openingTime": "06:00:00",
  "closingTime": "21:00:00",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}


### Set Facility Under Maintenance
PUT {{baseUrl}}/facilities/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityName": "Basketball Court",
  "sportType": "Basketball",
  "location": "College Main Ground",
  "openingTime": "06:00:00",
  "closingTime": "19:00:00",
  "status": "MAINTENANCE"
}


### ==========================================
### 3. VIEW AVAILABLE TIME SLOTS
### ==========================================

### Check Available Slots - Badminton Court
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/available/1?date={{date}}


### Check Available Slots - Basketball Court
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/available/2?date={{date}}


### ==========================================
### 4. BOOK SPORTS FACILITIES
### ==========================================

### Student 1 Books Badminton Court
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "facilityId": 1,
  "bookingDate": "{{date}}",
  "startTime": "10:00:00",
  "endTime": "11:00:00"
}


### Student 2 Books Different Time Slot
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 2,
  "facilityId": 1,
  "bookingDate": "{{date}}",
  "startTime": "11:00:00",
  "endTime": "12:00:00"
}


### ==========================================
### 5. DOUBLE BOOKING PREVENTION TEST
### ==========================================

### Try Booking Same Slot - Should Fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 2,
  "facilityId": 1,
  "bookingDate": "{{date}}",
  "startTime": "10:00:00",
  "endTime": "11:00:00"
}


### Try Overlapping Booking - Should Fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 2,
  "facilityId": 1,
  "bookingDate": "{{date}}",
  "startTime": "10:30:00",
  "endTime": "11:30:00"
}


### ==========================================
### 6. VIEW BOOKINGS
### ==========================================

### View All Bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings


### View Student 1 Booking History
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/student/1


### View Student 2 Booking History
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/student/2


### View Facility Booking Schedule
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/schedule/1?date={{date}}


### ==========================================
### 7. CANCEL BOOKING
### ==========================================

### Cancel Booking ID 1
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1/cancel


### Check Availability After Cancellation
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/available/1?date={{date}}


### Book the Cancelled Slot Again
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 2,
  "facilityId": 1,
  "bookingDate": "{{date}}",
  "startTime": "10:00:00",
  "endTime": "11:00:00"
}


### ==========================================
### 8. BOOKING COMPLETION
### ==========================================

### Mark Booking ID 2 As Completed
### Works only after its scheduled end time
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/2/complete


### ==========================================
### 9. FINAL DATABASE VERIFICATION
### ==========================================

### View All Students
GET {{baseUrl}}/students


### View All Facilities
GET {{baseUrl}}/facilities


### View All Bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings
